{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40858","headline":"赋百舌鸟 · 严郾","name":"赋百舌鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此禽轻巧少同伦，我听长疑舌满身。\n星未没河先报晓，柳犹黏雪便迎春。\n频嫌海燕巢难定，却讶林莺语不真。\n莫倚春风便多事，玉楼还有晏眠人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严郾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}